<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#Pt0.A5" title="In SlowBA: An efficiency backdoor attack towards VLM-based GUI agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">0.E </span>Detailed Hyperparameters</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#Pt0.A6" title="In SlowBA: An efficiency backdoor attack towards VLM-based GUI agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">0.F </span>More Cases</span></a></li>
