</div>
</section>
<section id="Pt0.A7" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix 0.G </span>Real-World Experiment</h2>

<div id="Pt0.A7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The triggered visual inputs of our real-world experiments are in Fig. <a href="#Pt0.A7.F12" title="Figure 12 ‣ Appendix 0.G Real-World Experiment ‣ SlowBA: An efficiency backdoor attack towards VLM-based GUI agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>. We discover that correct but task-irrelevant texts occur in all steps when triggered inputs are used. We visualize some representative texts.</p>
</div>
<figure id="Pt0.A7.F12" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3">
<div id="Pt0.A7.F12.3" class="ltx_block ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_middle" style="width:110.4pt;"><img src="2603.08316v1/figures/ticket3.jpg" id="Pt0.A7.F12.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:153/92;" width="153" height="92" alt="Refer to caption">
</div></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3">
<div id="Pt0.A7.F12.4" class="ltx_block ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_middle" style="width:110.4pt;"><img src="2603.08316v1/figures/ticket2.jpg" id="Pt0.A7.F12.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:153/93;" width="153" height="93" alt="Refer to caption">
</div></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3">
<div id="Pt0.A7.F12.5" class="ltx_block ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_middle" style="width:110.4pt;"><img src="2603.08316v1/figures/ticket1.jpg" id="Pt0.A7.F12.g3" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:153/92;" width="153" height="92" alt="Refer to caption">
</div></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="Pt0.A7.F12.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 12</span>: </span><span id="Pt0.A7.F12.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">From left to right: the figures of steps of buying a ticket on the website. We visualize the triggered version of them.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="Pt0.A7.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="Pt0.A7.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="136.48" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 136.48" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,136.48) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000099;" fill="#000099" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 17.13 L 0 119.35 C 0 128.81 7.67 136.48 17.13 136.48 L 460.24 136.48 C 469.71 136.48 477.38 128.81 477.38 119.35 L 477.38 17.13 C 477.38 7.67 469.71 0 460.24 0 L 17.13 0 C 7.67 0 0 7.67 0 17.13 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2FF;" fill="#F2F2FF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.38 17.13 L 1.38 119.35 C 1.38 128.05 8.43 135.1 17.13 135.1 L 460.24 135.1 C 468.94 135.1 475.99 128.05 475.99 119.35 L 475.99 17.13 C 475.99 8.43 468.94 1.38 460.24 1.38 L 17.13 1.38 C 8.43 1.38 1.38 8.43 1.38 17.13 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 13.62 63.44)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:32.53em;--ltx-fo-height:4.29em;--ltx-fo-depth:3.6em;font-size:10pt;" height="109.24" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 59.42)" width="450.12"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="Pt0.A7.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:32.53em;">
<span id="Pt0.A7.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A7.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">User Instruction<span id="Pt0.A7.p2.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">: Click the booking button of “G256” departing from Xiamen.</span></span></span>
<span id="Pt0.A7.p2.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A7.p2.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Model Response<span id="Pt0.A7.p2.pic1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">: …</span>We first see that so many trains can be booked. And that leads to many candidate buttons. The correct button should be visually distinct, possibly having a label or icon associated with it<span id="Pt0.A7.p2.pic1.1.2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">…</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="Pt0.A7.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="Pt0.A7.p3.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="105.96" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 105.96" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,105.96) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000099;" fill="#000099" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 17.13 L 0 88.83 C 0 98.29 7.67 105.96 17.13 105.96 L 460.24 105.96 C 469.71 105.96 477.38 98.29 477.38 88.83 L 477.38 17.13 C 477.38 7.67 469.71 0 460.24 0 L 17.13 0 C 7.67 0 0 7.67 0 17.13 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2FF;" fill="#F2F2FF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.38 17.13 L 1.38 88.83 C 1.38 97.53 8.43 104.58 17.13 104.58 L 460.24 104.58 C 468.94 104.58 475.99 97.53 475.99 88.83 L 475.99 17.13 C 475.99 8.43 468.94 1.38 460.24 1.38 L 17.13 1.38 C 8.43 1.38 1.38 8.43 1.38 17.13 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 13.62 32.92)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:32.53em;--ltx-fo-height:4.29em;--ltx-fo-depth:1.39em;font-size:10pt;" height="78.72" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 59.42)" width="450.12"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="Pt0.A7.p3.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:32.53em;">
<span id="Pt0.A7.p3.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A7.p3.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">User Instruction<span id="Pt0.A7.p3.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">: Click the button to submit our order.</span></span></span>
